<%- include('partials/top') %>

<div class="launcher">
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/institution">
    <span class="glyph">🏦</span>
    <span class="lbl">Institution<span class="cnt"><%= counts.institutions %> records</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/host">
    <span class="glyph">🖧</span>
    <span class="lbl">Host / Interchange<span class="cnt"><%= counts.hosts %> interfaces</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/prefix">
    <span class="glyph">🔢</span>
    <span class="lbl">Prefix<span class="cnt"><%= counts.prefixes %> prefixes</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/routing">
    <span class="glyph">🔀</span>
    <span class="lbl">Routing<span class="cnt"><%= counts.routing %> profiles</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/limit">
    <span class="glyph">⚖️</span>
    <span class="lbl">Limit Profiles<span class="cnt"><%= counts.limits %> profiles</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/cards">
    <span class="glyph">💳</span>
    <span class="lbl">Card Management<span class="cnt"><%= counts.cards %> cards</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="launch-ico" href="/simulator">
    <span class="glyph">▶️</span>
    <span class="lbl">Simulator<span class="cnt"><%= counts.journal %> in journal</span></span>
  </a>
</div>

<div class="mdi-window" style="max-width:580px">
  <div class="mdi-title"><span class="ico">ℹ️</span> BASE24-eps EPS Development — ESNCService
    <span class="spacer"></span>
    <span class="mini-win">_</span><span class="mini-win">▢</span><span class="mini-win close">✕</span>
  </div>
  <div class="mdi-body">
    <p style="margin-top:0"><b>Mobilpymes BASE24-eps Simulator</b> — didactic replica of the
    ACI BASE24-eps console <i>EPS Development / ESNCService</i>.</p>
    <p>Use the modules to configure the switch and then use <b>Transaction Simulator</b> to process
    real authorization flows:</p>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 8px; padding-left:16px; font-size:11px">
      <li><b>Institution</b> — configure card issuers (IDs, addresses, routing profiles)</li>
      <li><b>Host / Interchange</b> — define ISO interfaces and their Source Routing Profile</li>
      <li><b>Prefix</b> — map BIN ranges to issuers; set Route Type and Destination Routing Profile</li>
      <li><b>Routing</b> — Source Routing Profiles with ordered destination rules and filters</li>
      <li><b>Limit Profiles</b> — per-transaction and daily amount/count controls</li>
      <li><b>Card Management</b> — on-us cards with Positive Balance (account balances)</li>
      <li><b>Simulator</b> — send ISO 8583 authorization requests and inspect the full RTR trace</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="hint">Pre-loaded demo data: Institutions <b>BNK1</b> &amp; <b>PCBA_INST</b> ·
    Interfaces <b>VISA_BASE1</b>, <b>STAR_HOST</b>, <b>MASTERCARD_BNET</b> ·
    Prefixes <b>160107</b> (On-Us), <b>510510</b> (On-Us), <b>400000</b> (Not-On-Us), <b>222100</b> (Not-On-Us/Issuer-only) ·
    Source Routing Profile <b>STAR_SRC</b> · 6 demo cards with Positive Balance accounts.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mdi-status"><span class="ico">ℹ️</span> Ready</div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/bottom') %>
